  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mrow><mtable columnspacing=\"1.4ex\" columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>,&#160;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>then"
  },
  "options": [
