      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is continuous and differentiable at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
