      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is discontinuous and non differentiable at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
