  "solution": {
    "text": "Let us shift the graph of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in the direction of the negative <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis by <math><mn>4</mn></math> units<br />&amp; let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> will have the same behaviour&nbsp;as of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Continuity at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,<br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Differentiability at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mtext>lim</mtext><mrow><mtext>h</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mtext>lim</mtext><mrow><mtext>h</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>sin</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mfenced><msup><mtext>tan</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi>n&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mtext>lim</mtext><mrow><mtext>h</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mtext>lim</mtext><mrow><mtext>h</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>sin&#160;h</mtext><mo>.</mo><msup><mtext>tan</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mtext>h</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi>n&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math><br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is non-differentiable at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is non-differentiable at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
